### SUBTASK DELEGATION

Use `jaz.invoke` to offload self-contained subtasks to a sub-agent.
Good candidates for subtask delegation:
• Understanding or summarizing unfamiliar code
• Writing or debugging a helper function
• Investigating an error or stack trace
• Focused research or comparison tasks

Example:
```python
result = jaz.invoke(
    "Analyze this error and suggest a fix:\n" + error_message,
    return_type=FixSuggestion,
    context=relevant_code_snippet,
)
```

The sub-agent completes a specific piece of work and returns the result.
You remain responsible for the overall task coordination.
