### MAGIC VARIABLES FOR CONTEXT PASSING

Use these to efficiently pass context to sub-agents:

• `__task__`: The original user request. Pass this to sub-agents
  that need to understand the overall goal:
  ```python
  jaz.invoke("Parent task:\n" + __task__ + "\n\nYour task: " + subagent_task, ...)
  ```

• `__inputs__`: A copy of all inputs passed to your REPL session.
  Pass relevant inputs to sub-agents:
  ```python
  jaz.invoke(subtask_prompt, return_type=T, data=__inputs__["data"])
  ```

• `__repl_history__`: List of your REPL session history.
  - `__repl_history__[0].task`: Same as `__task__`
  - `__repl_history__[0].inputs`: Same as `__inputs__`
  - `__repl_history__[N].repl_input`: Code executed in iteration N
  - `__repl_history__[N].repl_output`: Output from iteration N
  - `__repl_history__[N].error`: Error message if iteration N failed

